// =============================================================================
// VEEQO INTEGRATION CONSTANTS
//
// Required for the dtb-integrations/Veeqo module to communicate with Veeqo.
//
// HOW TO GET THESE VALUES:
//   1. DTB_VEEQO_API_KEY
//      Log into Veeqo → Settings (gear icon) → API Keys → Create API Key.
//      Copy the full key and paste it below.
//
//   2. DTB_VEEQO_WEBHOOK_SECRET
//      Choose any strong random string (32+ chars). Configure the SAME string
//      in Veeqo → Settings → Webhooks when registering the DTB webhook URL:
//        https://drywalltoolbox.com/wp-json/dtb/v1/veeqo/webhooks/order
//      Veeqo will sign each delivery with HMAC-SHA256 of the raw body.
//
//   3. DTB_VEEQO_WAREHOUSE_ID / DTB_VEEQO_CHANNEL_ID
//      Both values are auto-discovered from the Veeqo API whenever you save the
//      API Key under WooCommerce → Settings → Integrations → Drywall Toolbox Veeqo.
//      DTB_VEEQO_CHANNEL_ID must be a Direct/Phone channel for API-created orders;
//      Veeqo rejects API-created orders against WooCommerce bridge channels.
//      Set them to 0 initially; they will be overwritten by auto-discovery.
//      You may also hard-code them after the first save for faster boot.
//
// NOTE: After adding/changing DTB_VEEQO_API_KEY, visit:
//   WP Admin → WooCommerce → Settings → Integrations → Drywall Toolbox Veeqo
//   and click Save to trigger channel + warehouse auto-discovery.
// =============================================================================

/** Veeqo API key — obtain from Veeqo → Settings → API Keys. REQUIRED. */
